abstract: >-
  Research software for generation of the CLANAK environmental and TLS
  handshake timing dataset, leakage-controlled ELM-LSTM Man-in-the-Middle
  detection, and extended statistical and machine-learning analysis under
  meteorological and diurnal conditions.
